From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:51:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] build: CPU-only LiteRT, no NPU vendor SDKs

v0.19.0 hard-codes -DLITERT_ENABLE_NPU=ON -DLITERT_ENABLE_QUALCOMM=ON for
LiteRT. With NPU on, LiteRT's vendors/ subdirectory downloads the Qualcomm
QAIRT and Samsung LiteCore SDK headers at configure time and builds the vendor
dispatch libraries. Turn NPU, Qualcomm and Samsung off (LiteRT then skips
vendors/ entirely) and generate build_config.h with
LITERT_BUILD_CONFIG_DISABLE_NPU=1 so the runtime matches.

The committed litert_litert_lm_target_map.cmake names the 17 Qualcomm and
Samsung vendor archives, and the build-time regeneration of that map never
runs (tflite.cmake force-sets the LITERTLM_GENERATE_TARGET_MAP cache entry
OFF inside a block(), which does not scope cache entries, before litert.cmake
reads it). Drop those archives from the map so litert_lm_main does not ask
for them ("No rule to make target .../libqnn_backends.a").

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
---
 cmake/packages/litert/litert.cmake              |  6 ++++--
 .../litert/litert_litert_lm_target_map.cmake    | 17 -----------------
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

diff --git a/cmake/packages/litert/litert.cmake b/cmake/packages/litert/litert.cmake
index 2312880f..f0c54aca 100644
--- a/cmake/packages/litert/litert.cmake
+++ b/cmake/packages/litert/litert.cmake
@@ -88,6 +88,7 @@ include(ExternalProject)
         "-DLITERTLM_HOST_PROTOC=${LITERTLM_HOST_PROTOC}"
         "-DLITERTLM_HOST_FLATC_BIN_DIR=${LITERTLM_HOST_FLATC_BIN_DIR}"
         "-DLITERTLM_HOST_FLATC=${LITERTLM_HOST_FLATC}"
+        -DLITERT_BUILD_CONFIG_DISABLE_NPU_VAL=ON
         -P "${LITERTLM_LITERT_PACKAGE_DIR}/litert_patcher.cmake"
 
     CMAKE_ARGS
@@ -184,8 +185,9 @@ include(ExternalProject)
         -DXNNPACK_SET_VERBOSITY=OFF
         -DTFLITE_ENABLE_GPU=OFF
         -DLITERT_ENABLE_GPU=OFF
-        -DLITERT_ENABLE_NPU=ON
-        -DLITERT_ENABLE_QUALCOMM=ON
+        -DLITERT_ENABLE_NPU=OFF
+        -DLITERT_ENABLE_QUALCOMM=OFF
+        -DLITERT_ENABLE_SAMSUNG=OFF
         -DLITERT_DISABLE_KLEIDIAI=ON
         -DLITERT_BUILD_C_API=ON
         -DLITERT_BUILD_TOOLS=OFF
